{"3396100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Third Person Basketball Court", "steam_appid": 3396100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 1v1 Matchmaking Added! Easiest Time to Find Matches!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Player Base Growing Fast! Top Streamers Are Playing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access launches on January 16, 2026 (JST)！！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could bring your favorite FPS/TPS button layouts onto the basketball court?<br>“TPBC” is a one-of-a-kind third-person basketball game that fuses the pinpoint aiming and smooth character control of shooters with the intense, fast-paced action of basketball.<br>Pull off spin moves, crossovers, and step-backs while locking onto the rim and firing your shot. Rack up points with your refined skills and unique playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer battles against players worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-court 1v1,2v2 matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump shots demand not only accuracy but also shot speed depending on distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of shooting motions including layups, floaters, and fadeaways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Context-based passing such as bounce passes, overhand passes, and behind-the-back passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus mini-game: Three-Point Contest</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 1v1 Matchmaking Added! Easiest Time to Find Matches!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Player Base Growing Fast! Top Streamers Are Playing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access launches on January 16, 2026 (JST)！！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could bring your favorite FPS/TPS button layouts onto the basketball court?<br>“TPBC” is a one-of-a-kind third-person basketball game that fuses the pinpoint aiming and smooth character control of shooters with the intense, fast-paced action of basketball.<br>Pull off spin moves, crossovers, and step-backs while locking onto the rim and firing your shot. Rack up points with your refined skills and unique playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer battles against players worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-court 1v1,2v2 matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump shots demand not only accuracy but also shot speed depending on distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of shooting motions including layups, floaters, and fadeaways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Context-based passing such as bounce passes, overhand passes, and behind-the-back passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus mini-game: Three-Point Contest</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Rise to the top of basketball with your aim and movement skills! “TPBC” is a third-person, online multiplayer basketball game that brings the familiar controls of FPS/TPS titles straight to the court. Take on skilled players from around the world and prove your mastery!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396100/35dee5610ca5d7132903044d474675fa26fea65d/header.jpg?t=1774963149", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396100/fd0831beaed0fb569ef5934c0ba4371a32407225/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774963149", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite